WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.562
CIJA Lobbying Pipeline.

00:00:02.512 --> 00:00:13.375
Intelligence cross-referencing algorithms have aggregated 579 unique lobbying instances mapped directly to the CIJA (Centre for Israel and Jewish Affairs).

00:00:13.375 --> 00:00:22.612
The complexity of this network makes manual traversal mathematically impossible, strictly classing this operation as an NP-HARD graph problem.
